.TH MYFILEFUNCTIONS 3 "September 2026" "Version 1.0" "MyUtils Library Manual"
.SH NAME
wordCount, mygrep \- file text analysis and pattern matching utilities
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include <myfilefunctions.h>
.sp
.BI "int wordCount(FILE *" file ", int *" lines ", int *" words ", int *" chars ");"
.br
.BI "int mygrep(FILE *" fp ", const char *" search_str ", char ***" matches ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
.TP
.B wordCount()
Scans the open file stream \fIfile\fR and counts total lines, words, and characters. Populates each integer pointer and returns 0 on success, or -1 on error.
.TP
.B mygrep()
Searches the open file stream \fIfp\fR for lines matching \fIsearch_str\fR. Dynamically allocates an array of string pointers stored in \fImatches\fR. Returns the count of matches found, or -1 on error.
